Wind and acceleration time histories during bridge vortex-induced vibration
Data license

This license covers all wind and girder acceleration measurements published
as part of this project. It includes the examples in the repository, all event
data archives distributed through GitHub Releases, and the MAT measurement
files for every event in those archives. The viv-data-v1 release contains
601 ZIP archives of event data.
https://github.com/TJ-wind/VIV-measurement-data-of-a-1650-suspension-bridge/releases/tag/viv-data-v1

These data are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International license (CC BY-NC 4.0). You may use, copy, share, and adapt
the data for noncommercial purposes, including research and teaching.
Commercial use requires separate permission from the data rights holder.

When sharing the original or adapted data, retain the attribution and license
notices supplied with the data, link to the license, and indicate any changes
you made. To identify the source, we suggest citing the dataset title,
“Wind and acceleration time histories during bridge vortex-induced vibration”,
and linking to the repository version you used.

Full license terms
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode.en
